stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Waiting : power on / find LCD, send HELLO
    Waiting : Waiting
    Waiting : entry / LCD "Step up to scan"
    Holding : Holding
    Holding : entry / LCD "Hold still" + bar
    Scanning : Scanning
    Scanning : entry / send READY, LCD "Scanning face..."
    Leaving : Leaving
    Leaving : entry / LCD "Next student"
    Testing : Testing
    Testing : LCD and distance tests
    state Result {
        Granted : Granted
        Granted : entry / "ACCESS GRANTED"
        Denied : Denied
        Denied : entry / "ACCESS DENIED"
        Already : Already
        Already : entry / "ALREADY INSIDE"
    }
    Waiting --> Holding : distance in 25-50 cm
    Holding --> Waiting : out of window > 200 ms
    Holding --> Scanning : held 1 s
    Scanning --> Granted : G
    Scanning --> Denied : D
    Scanning --> Already : A
    Scanning --> Waiting : student left / send AWAY
    Scanning --> Waiting : no answer in 6 s / LCD "No answer"
    Result --> Leaving : after 3 s
    Leaving --> Waiting : distance > 65 cm
    Waiting --> Testing : T command from PC
    Testing --> Waiting : TX or after 120 s
